<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen futures end slightly higher.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen futures end slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feb 26 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     99.25		   99.24</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Key December three-month Euroyen deposit rate futures ended Wednesday's TIFFE day session slightly higher.</p>
<p>The December settled at 99.25, after trading in a narrow three-tick range between 99.23 and 99.25.</p>
<p>&quot;Euroyen futures remained trapped in a very narrow range, only tracking Japanese government bond (JGB) futures' moves,&quot; said a city bank trader.</p>
</text>
